Retained reused evidence: USTR’s July 20, 2022 USMCA energy-consultation record from the prior ledger remains applicable to 5B.4, 5B.5, and 5B.10; it is reused, not counted as a newly discovered document. It described preferential treatment for CFE and PEMEX, permit delays or revocations, and possible effects on private investment.

